@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1 class="display-4">Authentication by API key + ApiKeyAuthFilter pipeline</h1>

<div class="container my-4">
    <div class="jumbotron bg-light p-5 rounded">

        <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold text-primary">Secure Workflows: Blazor to Web API Key Authentication</h2>
        <p class="lead text-muted">
            This page describes how the Blazor client and ASP.NET Core API exchange authenticated requests using an API key.
        </p>

        <div class="card shadow-sm border-0">
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="row g-3">

					<div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border bg-white rounded h-100">
                            <h5 class="text-primary"><strong>IHttpClientFactory</strong></h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0"><code>CreateClient("ApiClient")</code> returns a client configured with
                                                    <strong>ApiKeyDelegatingHandler()</strong></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border bg-white rounded h-100">
                            <h5 class="text-primary"><strong>Delegating Handler Adds API Key</strong></h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Before the request leaves the client,
                                                    <code>ApiKeyDelegatingHandler.SendAsync()</code> injects:
                                                    <br />
                                                    <code>X-API-KEY: &lt;client key&gt;</code></p>
                        </div>               
                    </div>

 
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border bg-white rounded h-100">
                            <h5 class="text-primary"><strong>Web API Filter Pipeline</strong></h5>
							<p class="text-muted mb-0"><code>ApiKeyAuthFilter()</code>> check  <code>X-API-KEY: &lt;client key&gt;</code> before the controller runs:
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>If header missing → <strong>401 Unauthorized</strong></li>
                                        <li>If header present but incorrect → <strong>401 Unauthorized</strong></li>
                                        <li>If header matches server key → filter calls <code>next()</code> and controller executes</li>
                                    </ul></p>
                        </div>    
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border bg-white rounded h-100">
                            <h5 class="text-primary"><strong>Response Returned</strong></h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Controller returns data, HttpClient receives it, and the Blazor component renders the UI.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


.workflow-font {
font-size: 1.25rem; /* Increase overall font size */
}

.workflow-font strong {
font-size: 1.35rem; /* Make section titles slightly larger */
}

.workflow-font code {
font-size: 1.15rem; /* Slightly larger code text */
}
